          "settings": {
            "question": "What is the difference between acupressure magnet patches and ear seeds?",
            "content": "<p>Both stimulate acupuncture points, but acupressure magnet patches use magnets and are applied to various parts of the body, while ear seeds are small seeds or beads placed on acupressure points on the ear.</p>"
